const builders = [{"summary":"B1 is built. /ekosistem now has the constellation hero, the three eco panels plus the Inti band, the scroll-driven flow, a tour band, a 5-item FAQ with no claims, and the WhatsApp band. /ekosistem/:eco has story, flow, tiles, buyers, cross-eco links and other ecosystems, plus the Inti variant. /lab has a hover/focus mini preview. I wrote 29 Playwright specs and all pass on the dev server. Two shared problems are outside my files and need the integrator. (1) The home load in my prod build is 254.4 KB, over the 253.6 limit. Part of the cause is that ui/Accordion is now split out of HomeSections because B2's routes/produk/Sections.tsx imports it. I removed my own Accordion import, so my files no longer add to this. (2) Each /lab hover preview, and every /produk mini, pulls the 43 KB demo-core chunk, because src/demos/mini-kit.tsx imports motionMode from demo-kit/ui/motion, which is pinned to demo-core.","notDone":["Screenshots in docs/shots/demo/tahap6/ were not written. I viewed scratch captures (ID and EN, 1440 and 390, all pages) and then deleted them to save disk. The final screenshots belong to the integrator's §6.6 pass.","No axe run; only manual a11y checks: one h1, buttons with labels, aria-live card, sr-only list, aria-pressed, 44 px targets checked by the spec.","Not tested at 360, 430 or 768. Only 390 and 1440 were checked.","Nothing was committed (as instructed)."],"handoff":["Integrator: mini-kit.tsx line 23 imports motionMode from '../demo-kit/ui/motion'. That file is in demo-core, so every mini costs about 43 KB more. Replace it with a local calm check using lib/motion.","Integrator: home is at 254.4 KB. One reason is that routes/produk/Sections.tsx (B2) imports components/ui/Accordion, which splits it out of HomeSections. Either B2 uses a local disclosure (as routes/eco/EcoFaq.tsx does) or the integrator pins Accordion into HomeSections.","Integrator: when a product's DEMO_READY flips, routes/eco/ready.ts must be updated as well. The drift test in tests/e2e/tahap6/ekosistem.spec.ts catches it if not. B2 could use the same mirror to keep registry/demo-core out of /produk.","My scratch is .shots/t6-b1/ (shot.mjs, budget.mjs, home.mjs, pw.config.ts). To rerun my specs on the dev server: npx playwright test -c .shots/t6-b1/pw.config.ts (BASE env overrides the URL)."],"budget":"/ekosistem 30.6 KB (target 45 / hard 60) · /ekosistem/:eco 31.5 KB (35/50) · /lab 25.3 KB (30/40) · /lab per hover preview +46.8 KB, which is 43.3 KB demo-core via mini-kit (target 15) · home 254.4 KB (limit 253.6, see checks)"},{"summary":"The product page part (B2) is done. The /produk/:slug template now has all 9 sections, the copy is written for all 18 products in ID and EN, and the 8 mini-demos P0–P7 are built. The first load is 27.9 KB gzip-9 (target 40), or 30.9 KB with the mini (target 55). Each mini is about 2 KB. `tsc` is clean and `copy.check --strict` reports no problems and no stubs. My 23 e2e tests pass on the dev server. The sweep of 17 pages × (390 ID, 1440 EN, 360 EN) found 0 console errors, no horizontal scroll and no buttons or links under 44 px. One thing to flag: home JS measured 254.4 KB on my build of the current tree, which is over the 253.6 limit. None of my files are in the home load. Nothing was committed.","notDone":["No screenshots in docs/shots/demo/tahap6/: plan §6.6 gives the final captures to the integrator, and disk C: is nearly full. Self-check views were taken in .shots/t6-b2 and deleted.","axe was not run (it is in the integrator's a11y.spec). A Lighthouse LCP run was not done either.","The B2 test checks only /Rp\\s?\\d/ rather than the plan's /harga|price/i. The plan's pattern always fails because product taglines such as Awas Belanja's and Sinyal Pasar's use 'harga' to mean market prices, and the contactLead says 'Tanpa daftar harga'.","The inti mini was only checked inside B1's /lab hover preview, because /produk/inti redirects. The product names on its nodes are shortened ('Siaga Wilay…') at that small preview size."],"handoff":["Integrator: home JS was 254.4 KB on my build of the current working tree, over the 253.6 limit. B2 adds nothing to the home load; the integrator should take this to B3.","In produk.spec, test.use({ reducedMotion: 'reduce' }) did not take effect with the shared fixtures (matchMedia stayed false), so I used page.emulateMedia instead. Other builders' specs that rely on test.use({ reducedMotion }) may silently not get reduced motion.","Produk reads SITE_DEMO_READY from B1's routes/eco/ready.ts and does not import registry.ts statically, so B1's drift test also covers /produk.","B3 / the integrator can reuse the mk-* building blocks in mini-kit.css and the onFrom() helper; the API is unchanged.","My scratch files are in C:/Users/LENOVO/gamada/.shots/t6-b2 (1.7 MB, scripts and a few small PNGs) and can be deleted."],"budget":"B2 product page first load 27.9–34.3 KB gzip-9 (target ≤ 40), or 30.9–37.2 KB with the mini (target ≤ 55); each mini about 2 KB (target ≤ 15)."},{"summary":"B3 (Situs) is built. The work covers the navbar Ekosistem dropdown and its mobile-menu group, the footer Ekosistem column, the home integration (hero CTA 2 → /ekosistem, Services as 3 ecosystem cards plus an Inti line and a custom-work line, the Ecosystem teaser with Inti and 3 ecosystems, Portfolio with 3 featured demos, and Stats from ecoNav), the merged cards on /karya restyled on the home Card, the redirects /karya/scrappulse and /produk/inti, and the 10 minis P8–P17 on mini-kit. My spec tests/e2e/tahap6/site.spec.ts passes 22/22 on the dev server. In a prod build, home JS measures 253.58 KB, which is under the 253.6 limit but leaves almost no headroom. Every one of my /produk pages loads in about 30 KB, and each mini adds 1.6–1.9 KB. `npx tsc -b` and `tsc --noEmit` are clean, and the control-byte grep printed nothing. Nothing was committed.","notDone":["The home JS margin is about 0.02 KB, so any extra eager byte from any builder or the integrator will cross 253.6. A HEAD baseline build measured 252.7. Since then motion.ts (ECO_SITE) adds about +0.2, and a new 1.0 KB Accordion chunk appears because other builders' routes also import Accordion (before, it sat inside HomeSections). To get under the limit I had to cut my own additions: shorter home copy, no bullet points in the teaser panel, compact SVG art, and ecosystem kickers taken from ecoNav.","The full old e2e suite was not run (gate / integrator). The old specs that touch my areas are routes.spec and polish.spec (lang toggle on /ekosistem). I checked them by reading and they do not depend on anything I changed.","Lighthouse LCP and the home perf A/B were not run (integrator gate per plan §5/§6.7)."],"handoff":["Files outside my §4 list that I touched minimally: src/components/SceneCopy.tsx (the hero CTA 2 StartButton now gets onClick → goTo('/ekosistem'); needed for §2.6 because the label lives in scenes.ts) and src/styles/site.css (appended navbar/footer/karya CSS blocks marked 'Tahap 6, B3'; the Navbar and Footer styles live there).","Integrator: home JS has essentially no headroom (253.58 of 253.6). Two things that are not mine add to it: the motion.ts ECO_SITE block (about +0.2) and the Accordion split chunk (+1.0, which moved out of HomeSections because other builders' routes also import Accordion). Any further eager growth needs a decision: either raise the budget or move something such as the Footer column / ecoNav examples out of the eager path.","B2: mini captions in toko-autopilot, juara-jualan and sinyal-pasar contain 'harga'/'price' as product-feature words ('Saran harga diterapkan', 'keberatan harga', 'prediksi harga'). If produk.spec greps visible caption text for /harga|price/, it must treat the 'Simulasi · {caption}' line as simulasi-marked.","home/stats.ts keys changed (products/ecosystems/demos replace pagesAndDemos/mobileApps/enterpriseProjects). SITE.stats is unchanged and still used by faq.ts.","Scratch kept (51 KB) in C:/Users/LENOVO/gamada/.shots/t6-b3/: a mini harness (h.html/h.tsx; open http://127.0.0.1:5173/.shots/t6-b3/h.html?s=slug1,slug2), pw.config.ts (runs site.spec against dev: `npx playwright test -c .shots/t6-b3/pw.config.ts`) and measure.mjs. The dist folder and the baseline copy were deleted (the node_modules junction was removed with rmdir first)."],"budget":"Home JS 253.58/253.6 KB gzip-9 (baseline 252.7). My /produk pages are ~30 KB each and each mini is 1.6–1.9 KB. /karya is 16.5 KB."}]

